    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d671">

                <pb facs="0653" n="579" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg579"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Tassara</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-11-07"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 7, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The undersigned, Secretary of State of the United States, has the honor to
                    acknowledge the receipt of the note of Mr. Tassara, envoy extraordinary and
                    minister plenipotentiary of her Catholic Majesty, upon the subject of the
                    steamship Harriet Lane, now lying in the port of Havana.</p>
                <p>In reply, the undersigned has the honor to inform Mr. Tassara that the matter
                    will receive due attention, and that the consul general of the United States
                    there has been empowered to set on foot proceedings, on behalf of this
                    government, against the vessel in question in the courts of Cuba.</p>
                <p>The power is herewith enclosed, and the undersigned will thank Mr. Tassara to
                    attest the same and return it to this department.</p>
                <p>The undersigned avails himself of this occasion to offer to Mr. Tassara a renewed
                    assurance of his very high consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Señor Don <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gabriel Garcia y Tassara</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c., Washington.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
